        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>THE NORTHERN UNION. Results of Saturday's Matches.</p>
        <p>NORTHERN UNION CUP.--SECOND ROUND. G. T. P. Wakefield Trinity 2 3 13 Keighley Oldham 3 212 Wigan 1 2 8 Dewsbury 0 3 9 Salford Hnddersfleld nun ..</p>
        <p>Halifax 5 3 19 Broughton R.... 1 2 8 Borrow 0 0 0 Batley Hull K R 0 1 3 Warrington</p>
