      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1912-03-09_WidnesExaminer_art0081" n="art0081">
        <head>_ MARKET PRICES.</head>
        <p>_ MARKET PRICES.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON (WEDNESDAY). FRESH Eoos,llo LARGE SOLES, 13 Sd FRESH BUTTER, 114 to 1/5 SMALL SOLES, Is 10d CHEESE, 10d and lid SALMON TROUT, 2s RABBITS, 2s 6d couple HALIBUT, Is and Is 4d (English) COD, 6d. FOWLS 2s Od to 3s 9d HAKE, Bd. POTATOES, 6s 6d a load PLAICE, ed to Bd. BEEF, 6d to 10d per 11b. LOBSTERS, 2s per lb. MUTTON, Gd to 10d per lb. SALMON, 35 per lb PORK, Kid LO 9id per lb. EYEMOUTIL HADDOCK, 8d VEAL, 8d to 10d. BRILL, 13 WHEAT, 5s to 55 Id per 70Ibe. OATS, 3s to 3s Id per 451bs. WHEAT STRAW, £3 7s per ton. JDAT STRAW, £3 2s 6d to £3 103 per ton. XX FLOUR 23s 9d per 2401b5. BRAN, 1e 2} per 20Iba.</p>
